DOC|subsystem_tools|v1|updated=2026-03-14e
META|inertia=LOW|parent=architecture_root.dsb|hot_reloadable=yes
META|files=tools/*.py,tools/registry.py

DESIGN_POINTS|
  DP1|AI-agnostic: tools know nothing about which AI calls them; reasoner adapters convert to protocol
  DP2|self-registration: each module calls registry.register(Tool(...)) at module level on import
  DP3|schema normalization: to_openai_schema() wraps shorthand params in {"type":"object","properties":{}} for gpt-4o-mini
  DP4|hot-reloadable: reload_module() re-executes registration; registry updated automatically
  DP5|reactive habits: code_ref+twm_ttl_seconds in PROC metadata → tool auto-dispatch + TWM result

REGISTRY|
  class=Tool(name,description,parameters,fn)|execute(**kwargs)→str
  to_anthropic_schema()|to_openai_schema()|to_text_description()
  registry.execute(name,kwargs)|returns error string on unknown tool (never raises)
  load=tools/__init__.py imports all modules; hot_reload.py added 2026-03-13

