LEARNER|
  entry=learn_about(user_input) — strips trigger, searches Calibre (non-fiction filter), browser AI discovery
  tonight=detected from input → queues Calibre books too; nothing launches immediately
  local=all background launches use --local (Ollama qwen2.5:7b, free)
  queue=~/.TheIgors/learn_queue.json|calibre://ID sentinel for Calibre books|URLs for web sources
  drain_manual=process_learn_queue(max_items=5) — 3s human pace between launches
  drain_background=drain_learn_queue() → spawns claudecode/drain_learn_queue.py (PID-guarded, 60s between, loops until empty)
  auto_drain=learn_about() calls _launch_queue_runner() whenever items queued
  caching=book_learner adds cache_control:ephemeral to system prompt for Claude models via OR
  book_learner=claudecode/book_learner.py --calibre-id|--url|--local|--run|--resume
  drain_runner=claudecode/drain_learn_queue.py --delay SECS|PID=~/.TheIgors/drain_learn_queue.pid

